# rawpty: raw mode on -> READY -> readKey loop; ESC quits.
# Proves raw-mode, KeyChar, CSI arrow, Ctrl-C, lone-ESC flush, quit + exit.
# "send xy" feeds TWO keys in one write — proving the multi-byte consume
# (both K:char:x and K:char:y must be delivered, not just the first).
expect READY
send xy
expect K:char:x
expect K:char:y
send \e[A
expect K:up
send \x03
expect K:ctrl:c
send \e
expect K:esc
expect_exit 0
